**QUESTION**
Largest Element
Given an array of integers nums, return the value of the largest element in the array

**CONSTRAINTS**
1 <= nums.length <= 105
-104 <= nums[i] <= 104
nums may contain duplicate elements.

**CODE**
class Solution:
    def largestElement(self, nums):
        return max(nums)
        
**ABOUT MY CODE**
Time:- O(n)
Space:- O(1)
Approach:- Math, Array
